{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211580","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211580","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:0:1321158001:0":{"text":"你悄悄扔出祝福药水，一股神圣而温暖的气息随之包裹住了娜塔莎和阿尔希普……","source_cn":"你悄悄扔出祝福药水，一股神圣而温暖的气息随之包裹住了娜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E63EB4828C93E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321158002:1":{"text":"咦……？","source_cn":"咦……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D4147835917B2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321158003:1":{"text":"怎么了，娜塔莎？","source_cn":"怎么了，娜塔莎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4BE55EE9339B34F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321158004:1":{"text":"阿尔希普，你有没有感受到一种很温暖的感觉？就像是……像是修士们为我们洗礼时的那种感觉，但比那更纯净更强烈！","source_cn":"阿尔希普，你有没有感受到一种很温暖的感觉？就像是……像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A07AA1A56514E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321158005:1":{"text":"确实有这种感觉……而且很神圣。","source_cn":"确实有这种感觉……而且很神圣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBBAC3EC92A8978","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"sa